---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="EPC Glasgow for Landlords & Homeowners | Scotland EPC"
  description="Book a Glasgow EPC (RdSAP) assessment with Scotland EPC. Fast appointments, clear certificates, and simple online quote requests."
  canonicalPath="/epc-glasgow"
>
  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="container-pro max-w-4xl space-y-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900">EPC (RdSAP) Assessments in Glasgow</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-700">Need an EPC in Glasgow for a rental, sale, or compliance check? Scotland EPC provides professional RdSAP assessments with a straightforward booking process and practical turnaround times.</p>
      <div class="quote-card space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">What to expect</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-slate-700 space-y-1">
          <li>Clear onsite assessment of your property.</li>
          <li>Compliant EPC output suitable for marketing and tenancy use.</li>
          <li>Flexible appointments in Glasgow and nearby areas.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-700">Start with the <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="/#quote">instant quote form on our homepage</a> or call <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="tel:+447483881889">+44 7483 881889</a>.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-700">Also see <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="/epc-edinburgh">EPC assessments in Edinburgh</a> and <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="/legionella-risk-assessment-glasgow">Legionella risk assessments in Glasgow</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
